    {% if _prefMaterial != "" %}
    - {{ npc.name }}'s own background/personality shows a preference for {{ _prefMaterial }} gear — pick a {{ _prefMaterial }} item for this lock if one exists in the Eligible Actions list below. If no {{ _prefMaterial }} option exists for this slot, fall back to {{ _rndMaterial }}.
    {% else %}
    - No stated material preference for {{ npc.name }} — pick {{ _rndMaterial }} this time if it exists in the Eligible Actions list below. Vary it call to call; do not default to Black Leather out of habit just because it is a familiar name.
    {% endif %}
    - Acceptable generic names: Black Leather, Iron, Padded, Steel, Chain, Ebonite, or the plainest matching item. Do not pick ebonite rainbows, tape, "hidden arms", pony gear, quest-named, or extra-long SKUs unless the intent named that exact toy.
